  "historyNote": "#12803, eff 12-15-19; amd by #12954, eff 12-24-19; amd by #13124, eff 10-23-20; ss by #13777, eff 10-13-23; ss by #14349, INTERIM, eff 8-26-25; ss by #14471, eff 1-2-26, EXPIRES: 1-2-36",
